{
  "mod": {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": 898,
      "hub_id": 1215,
      "guid": "com.kmyuhkyuk.kmytarkovapi",
      "name": "Kmy Tarkov Api",
      "slug": "kmy-tarkov-api",
      "teaser": "Api Framework for Client Mods",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/1215.png",
      "downloads": 395080,
      "favourites_count": 174,
      "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Api</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>This framework provides Modder with Api interface compatible multiple Tarkov game versions</p>\n<p>(3.11.0 +)</p>\n<p>Reference KmyTarkovApi.dll Quick access eft instance by EFTGlobal or Register Hook by EFTHelpers</p>\n<p>Currently Api is Experimental, If it cause issue or your want merge Feature, Submit Issues to <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/kmyuhkyuk/KmyTarkovApi/issues\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">here</a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Reflection</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Get Access Delegate of Method Field Property from RefHelper</p>\n<p>Quickly Get Type or MethodInfo from RefTool</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">ConfigurationManager</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>A new Configuration Manager, Home Key Open</p>\n<p>It will get mod icon, download count, download link and check mod version from Aki Hub mod web page.</p>\n<p>And it supports localization setting name</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Install</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Extract BepInEx folder from 7z to Game Root directory</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Support Me</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Make and Update Mods spends a lot of my free time</p>\n<p>You can support me on one of website below that way I can motivated continue to do modding work</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://afdian.net/a/kmyuhkyuk\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">AfDian</a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.buymeacoffee.com/kmyuhkyuk\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">BuymeaCoffee</a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://patreon.com/kmyuhkyuk\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Patreon</a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-6\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Repost</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Please do not repost on other websites without my consent</p>\n<p>This mod only released on</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://sns.oddba.cn/75284.html\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Oddba</a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1215-eft-api\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SPT</a></p></div></div></div>\n",
